00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:37.200
This is nothing!

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:43.570
The attempts to drive out Borka's robbers have failed time and time again,

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:45.910
and now the season has changed.

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:49.120
The woods were strangely deserted.

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:54.480
Birk never came to Ronja's forest, not even once.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:58.250
And then, winter came.

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:05.560
The Unescapable Snow Hole

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:05.560
The Unescapable Snow Hole

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:25.280
Good morning, Turre!

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:33.850
Wow...

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:20.170
Do you have to make a face like you're digging a grave?

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:26.180
If you want a grave that badly, I'll dig one for you...

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:27.490
old man.

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:45.320
At this rate, it will be spring before you finish up.

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:52.790
Everyone gets depressed when they think about how long they'll have to deal with this winter.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:57.340
We always have to eat dried vegetables, or salted meats...

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:59.800
And we can't even do any robbing.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:05.490
The only thing left for us to do every day is to remove the snow from the roof and the roads.

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.370
Looks good.

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:30.830
Seems like you'll be able to wear this for a while.

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:54.350
Thanks, Mom!

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:57.120
Be careful with those, okay?

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:57.950
Yup.

00:04:57.950 --> 00:04:59.930
I will for sure!

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:10.250
Wow...

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:13.490
Everyone!

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:17.360
Isn't the snow beautiful?!

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:23.320
Ronja!

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:42.980
Hey! How dare you, Pelje!

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:51.490
It'll take more than that to hit me.

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:53.750
Is that right?!

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:06.260
Pelje!

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:31.030
Why you...

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:31.700
Take this!

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:33.780
Here!

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:35.200
There!

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:42.130
Darn.

00:07:08.790 --> 00:07:09.980
No way it'll hit me.

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:12.570
Give me a break...

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:15.530
Nice.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:23.920
Hey, Ronja!

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:57.490
I told you clear the snow!

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.850
What are you trying to do? Make it worse?!

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:29.230
I always pull the short straw...

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:33.300
Who do you think has to make a path for you? I'm the one clearing the snow.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:36.860
You always think you're the worst off.

00:08:36.860 --> 00:08:44.250
In the first place, drawing water is a job for someone who has plenty of fat to keep them warm.

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:46.370
Wh-What did you say?

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:49.370
When I die from the snow caving in,

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:52.420
I'll show up by your bedside as a ghost!

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:55.420
The ghost of Tjorm?

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:58.240
What a story that would be.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:01.430
I'd be laughing so hard, I'd probably pee my pants.

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:02.720
Shit!

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:07.210
It'd be scary! You'd be scared if you saw me as a ghost!

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:08.500
If you say so.

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:09.690
I'll show up tonight!

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:12.120
Shut up! You're not dead yet, are you?!

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:12.960
Oh.

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:21.140
Ronja!

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:25.180
Over here!

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:31.330
Come up here!

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:35.210
Yeah, on my way!

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:56.950
I wonder where I put it...

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:01.920
What are you looking for?

00:10:03.050 --> 00:10:05.700
Be sure to clean up any mess you make!

00:10:08.110 --> 00:10:10.040
Mattis! Do you hear me?

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:23.440
Found it!

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:31.950
I used this set when I was a child.

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:01.440
Ronja! How's it going?

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:03.560
Yeah, pretty good.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.520
Good luck!

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:52.930
Ronja, the Robber's Daughter

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:52.930
Ronja, the Robber's Daughter

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:40.130
I'm fine with it if everything's alright...

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:44.170
I just hope nothing awful happens to her.

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:49.230
I wouldn't be able to live with myself if anything happened to her.

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:53.920
What are you moaning about?

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:59.370
That child has a better head on her shoulders than any robber.

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:09.380
How many times do I have to tell you that before you understand?

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:19.350
I'm off!

00:15:20.490 --> 00:15:22.540
Be careful!

00:15:28.220 --> 00:15:32.300
Ronja was confident she could handle anything herself.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:35.030
But on this day,

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:40.410
something happened that Mattis should never find out about.

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:15.620
Should I head back already?

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:25.540
Last run of the day!

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:14.250
What should I do?

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:22.740
Woffor did un do that?

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:23.440
Don't know.

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:38.260
Wow! Rumphobs!

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:44.770
I'm so glad you aren't one of those gray dwarves or nasty harpies.

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:49.270
Because rumphobs are kind and gentle,

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:53.020
you wouldn't do anything awful, right?

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:02.890
Hey.

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.920
Woffor did un want to do that?{These lines used to reflect the rumphobs speech.}

00:19:06.300 --> 00:19:08.960
Woffor did un do that?

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:13.130
Woffor did un do that? Broke our roof?

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:14.860
Roof?

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:31.680
Woffor did un broke our roof?

00:19:34.840 --> 00:19:37.150
I didn't mean to!

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:40.220
Hey, I can't pull my foot out.

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:42.660
Help me pull myself out of the hole!

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:46.400
Hey.

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:49.810
Un's stuck in t'roof.

00:19:49.810 --> 00:19:52.670
Woffor did un do it?

00:19:53.280 --> 00:19:54.880
Then, help me!

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:57.670
If you help, I should be able to get my foot out!

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:01.910
Okay?

00:20:05.650 --> 00:20:07.580
Please, wait!

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:08.780
Don't go!

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:50.430
It's cradle.

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:51.610
Yup.

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:53.310
Wh-What?

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:56.230
We will use it.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:57.420
Yup.

00:21:01.020 --> 00:21:02.780
It can be cradle?

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:03.600
Yup.

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:13.250
Lil boy, he hang good there.

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:15.670
It can be cradle?

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:16.640
Yup.

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:19.640
Un's nasty foot.

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:24.600
Un's foot, stuck in roof willy-nilly.

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:25.210
Yup.

